
### Get all projects
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects

### Add a new project
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=E-Commerce&description=Online shopping application

### Get all projects after adding
GET http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects

### Add project without a name (should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/task_manager_war/projects
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=&description=Project without a name
